<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F6.fig2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 6</span>: </span><span id="S4.F6.fig2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Parameter efficient fine-tuning with PIZA.</span></figcaption>
